# Merge and diff rules for the servo-group repo.
# For a private trial, put these lines in .git/info/attributes of your own clone
# (they override the committed .gitattributes for you only).
# For the whole team, replace the "*.MAPS binary" and "*.mdl binary" lines in the
# committed .gitattributes with these.
*.MAPS        merge=maps diff=maps
*.MAPS.static binary
*.mdl         binary merge=mlAutoMerge
*.slx         binary merge=mlAutoMerge
